### Login para Autenticar
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Senha123!"
}

### 1. Create a new client
# Creates a new client entry in the database (Default active: true)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: better-auth.session_token=meu-token-secreto-123

{
  "type": "INDIVIDUAL",
  "name": "João da Silva",
  "whatsapp": "51999999999",
  "location": "Lajeado/RS",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "document": "12345678900",
  "notes": "Initial test client"
}

### 2. List all clients
# Fetches all client records ordered by creation date
GET http://localhost:4000/api/clients



### 3. Get client by ID
# Fetch a specific client using the UUID returned from the POST request
# Replace the UUID below with a valid ID from your database
GET http://localhost:4000/api/clients/f097232b-78ab-45d9-8c6d-87f7be2cb38e


### 4. Update a client
# Partial update using Zod validation schema
# Replace the UUID below with a valid ID
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/clients/f097232b-78ab-45d9-8c6d-87f7be2cb38e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João da Silva Updated"
}

### 5. Deactivate a client (Logical soft delete)
# Sets the 'active' property to false while maintaining historical data
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/clients/f097232b-78ab-45d9-8c6d-87f7be2cb38e/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{}